    <string name="dialog_changelog_title">Changelog</string>
    <string name="changelog_v104_title">v1.0.4</string>
    <string name="changelog_v104_body" formatted="false">• Optimized Bluetooth scanning for battery life with 3-tier automatic step-down and low-power standby while preserving fast open-case popups\n• Reduced connected headset polling overhead by removing idle thread wakeups and extending screen-off intervals\n• Silenced verbose background logs when Debug Mode is off to cut unnecessary wakeups</string>
    <string name="changelog_v103_title">v1.0.3</string>
    <string name="changelog_v103_body" formatted="false">• Added ColorOS 17 Living Flow UI alongside live Classic UI switching with auto OS-version defaults (Living Flow on ColorOS 17+, Classic on ColorOS 16 &amp; below) and full ColorOS 15–17 compatibility\n• Refined ColorOS 17 anchored popup menus, circular glass back buttons, Update Notes page, and dark-mode visuals\n• Fixed WF-1000XM3 &amp; Tandem V1 auto power-off bug (fixed protocol version detection and blocked unsafe 0x22 frames) and adapted full V1 controls (NC/ASM, DSEE HX, connection mode, wear pause, auto power off, touch sensors, and EQ)\n• Significantly sped up pairing and open-case popups: fixed BLE hardware APCF ScanFilter and ColorOS scan throttling, added cross-RPA correlation and BR/EDR pre-discovery\n• Prioritized initial battery probes with faster RFCOMM backoff, lower dual-ear sync delay, and async foreground state broadcasts\n• Eliminated main-thread UI stalls with in-memory artwork caching, async IPC/CDN artwork loading, and skipping idle battery polling on unpaired popups</string>
    <string name="changelog_v102_title">v1.0.2</string>
    <string name="changelog_v102_body" formatted="false">• Fixed Control Center &amp; widget battery/icon readout: shows lowest earbud battery while keeping L/R indicators instead of the charging case\n• Improved Control Center expanded sheet top blur to blend with the live dynamic backdrop\n• Added automatic changelog popup on first launch after updating</string>
    <string name="changelog_v101_title">v1.0.1</string>
    <string name="changelog_v101_body" formatted="false">• Comprehensive Sony Sound Connect Feature Adaptation: integrated four full-featured control pages — Sound &amp; Noise Control, Touch &amp; Smart Controls, Connection &amp; Multipoint, and Auto Power Off\n• Added 6-band custom Equalizer (400Hz–16kHz + Clear Bass) synchronized with Sony presets, real-time drag tuning, and one-tap reset\n• Added Left/Right Touch Sensor assignment, Speak-to-Chat sensitivity &amp; auto-close timeout, Wear Detection, Auto Power Off conditions, Voice Guidance, and Multipoint paired-device switching\n• Added Speak-to-Chat quick toggle tile to the ColorOS volume slider detail panel and fixed Control Center headset card offline/online icon inversion\n• Complete ColorOS 17 UI &amp; Interaction Overhaul: seamless Level-2/3 slide navigation in Bluetooth Details &amp; Control Center sheets with progressive top Gaussian blur headers, native transition curves, and anti-mistouch gesture handling\n• Added collapsing large header in main app, ColorOS 17 damped spring overscroll bounce across all lists &amp; bottom sheets, and floating COUI sheets &amp; anchored popup menus\n• Hardened Sony Tandem RFCOMM reliability (thread-safe write lock &amp; dynamic GS slot resolution) and fixed remote changelog formatting</string>
    <string name="changelog_v100_title">v1.0.0</string>
    <string name="changelog_v100_body" formatted="false">• Integrated Sony headphones with ColorOS 16/17 native AirPods pipeline, Device Space, and Fluid Cloud capsules\n• Real-time dual-earbud &amp; case battery via Sony Tandem V1/V2 with asynchronous dual-ear sync &amp; live Fluid Cloud updates\n• Native Quick Settings, volume slider, and detail card controls for ANC / Ambient / Off, Ambient Level (1–20), Voice Focus, Speak-to-Chat, DSEE, and LDAC/AAC codec switching\n• Fast BLE pairing-mode popup detection, native pairing dialog suppression, and automatic Sound Connect handover\n• Bundled Sony official transparent artwork catalog and in-app update checker sourcing from LSPosed Repository</string>
